{"ID":"20240118151220-kthwrvq","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151220-kthwrvq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151220-kthwrvq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151220-rwejl97\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122113755-vjfkqss\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122113755-vjfkqss\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:120,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:120\u0026#125;","title":"130鲤鱼胆","type":"doc","updated":"20240130155712"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151220-rwejl97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151220-rwejl97","updated":"20240122113748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦寒，主目热，赤痛，青盲，明目，久服强悍，益志气．功同青鱼胆。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113751-ieszsha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113751-ieszsha"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】即鲤鱼体内之胆。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113753-l2gx23v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113753-l2gx23v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113753-9cyaweb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113753-9cyaweb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附方】赤眼肿痛——鲤鱼胆五枚，黄连末半两，和匀，入蜂蜜少许，瓶盛，安饭上蒸熟，每日点目眦，日五七次。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113800-t5ubqs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113800-t5ubqs9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴痿——鲤鱼胆，雄鸡肝各一枚，为末，雀卵和丸小豆大，每吞一丸。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122113755-csa1td0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113755-csa1td0"}},{"ID":"20240122113801-i8yuqd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113801-i8yuqd9"}},{"ID":"20240122113755-ysriw3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113755-ysriw3z"}},{"ID":"20240122113755-vjfkqss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122113755-vjfkqss","updated":"20240130155712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"130，鲤鱼胆，鲤鱼胆呢过去用来点眼睛，来治疗眼睛的翳，眼睛白内障啊，眼刺痛、红肿。能够明目，对眼睛非常的好，我们各种的蛇胆、鱼胆，胆类的东西对眼睛都很好，因为肝开窍在眼睛，肝胆是表里。唐容川说这个鲤鱼胆，它味苦又生水中，正得水性．为治肝胆火之正药。后面的配方，诸位可以参考一下，什么时候可以用鲤鱼胆。"}]}]}